{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02653",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.85,
      "end_seconds": 6.9,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "All set here, doctor. Chart's updated, and I'll read the readings out when you're ready."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.89,
      "end_seconds": 12.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Thank you. Good morning, tell me what's been going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.11,
      "end_seconds": 20.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "so the thing is, um, I've got my heart suddenly racing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 21.99,
      "end_seconds": 30.39,
      "duration_seconds": 8.4,
      "text": "okay, so the vitals from earlier spO2 99 percent on room air, temp 36.9 degrees, pressure 122 over 78, pulse 65."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.31,
      "end_seconds": 35.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "good, thank you when did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.81,
      "end_seconds": 49.04,
      "duration_seconds": 11.23,
      "text": "honestly I can't say exactly when it started it might have been last month or the month before I really can't pin it down"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.0,
      "end_seconds": 53.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "have you tried anything for it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.17,
      "end_seconds": 60.32,
      "duration_seconds": 6.15,
      "text": "I mean, it settles a little with cold water on the face"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.44,
      "end_seconds": 65.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "have you had a pounding in your neck?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.35,
      "end_seconds": 75.01,
      "duration_seconds": 8.66,
      "text": "right, yeah. One week, I'd say i'd been feeling lightheaded during an episode, but that went away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.89,
      "end_seconds": 92.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "nothing like fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.11,
      "end_seconds": 95.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Definitely no fainting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.24,
      "end_seconds": 102.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "Have you noticed chest pain, breathlessness or family history of sudden death?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.22,
      "end_seconds": 106.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "no, nothing to report there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.28,
      "end_seconds": 113.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "okay is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.79,
      "end_seconds": 116.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.96,
      "end_seconds": 120.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.29,
      "end_seconds": 122.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.32,
      "end_seconds": 125.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.3,
      "end_seconds": 131.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.95,
      "end_seconds": 134.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.93,
      "end_seconds": 138.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.21,
      "end_seconds": 142.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.26,
      "end_seconds": 147.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.0,
      "end_seconds": 151.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.37,
      "end_seconds": 154.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.2,
      "end_seconds": 158.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.83,
      "end_seconds": 164.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.55,
      "end_seconds": 183.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.49,
      "end_seconds": 191.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.48,
      "text": "I I had a cataract operation in my left eye about a year ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.11,
      "end_seconds": 195.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "tell me your medicines please"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.02,
      "end_seconds": 202.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "Thyronorm. I take it 50 micrograms every morning for my thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.84,
      "end_seconds": 207.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "let me ask about allergies anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.61,
      "end_seconds": 212.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.6,
      "end_seconds": 217.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.65,
      "end_seconds": 224.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "yes, an underactive thyroid"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.3,
      "end_seconds": 231.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "Yes, an underactive thyroid is known to us, good to have that clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.69,
      "end_seconds": 236.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "let's move on to the examination"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.77,
      "end_seconds": 240.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "so I'll listen to your chest now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.37,
      "end_seconds": 251.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Your heart sounds and rhythm are normal today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.94,
      "end_seconds": 253.64,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.01,
      "end_seconds": 259.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Alright, thank you, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.06,
      "end_seconds": 285.42,
      "duration_seconds": 15.36,
      "text": "Putting it all together, I think we're dealing with episodes of supraventricular tachycardia at this stage. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. Atrial fibrillation is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.23,
      "end_seconds": 293.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "will it it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.13,
      "end_seconds": 313.48,
      "duration_seconds": 18.35,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like episodes of supraventricular tachycardia. Try blowing hard against a closed mouth and nose when it starts. Do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.83,
      "end_seconds": 318.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.95,
      "end_seconds": 321.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "look after yourself"
    }
  ]
}